                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16821819" author="nizhikov" created="Fri, 19 Apr 2019 10:05:11 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=isapego&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;isapego&quot;&gt;isapego&lt;/a&gt; You shouldn&apos;t increment version. &lt;br/&gt;
Why do you want to do it?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thin client version incremented in each release that has uncompatible changes in protocol.&lt;br/&gt;
Changes from &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9113&quot; title=&quot;Allocate memory for a data region when first cache assigned to this region is created&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9113&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9113&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11043&quot; title=&quot;CPP Thin: Improve Best Effort Affinity for C++ thin client&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-11043&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-11043&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; should use the same 1.3.0 version.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16821937" author="isapego" created="Fri, 19 Apr 2019 14:04:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=NIzhikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;nizhikov&quot;&gt;NIzhikov&lt;/a&gt;, there is no such commitment, that we only increment protocol version no more than once per release. I do not see why can not we use two different versions here, as it looks like a sound and most clear solution. It looks definitely more clear than adding some workaround non-working code in .Net client. Also, it will make it look, like .Net supports Affinity Awareness, which is not true yet. Lately, if .Net implementation will be included in release, we can always make it one version again.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16821952" author="isapego" created="Fri, 19 Apr 2019 14:22:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Ready. TC pass: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F6484%2Fhead&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F6484%2Fhead&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16821968" author="isapego" created="Fri, 19 Apr 2019 14:47:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=jooger&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;jooger&quot;&gt;jooger&lt;/a&gt;, can you please review?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16821972" author="jooger" created="Fri, 19 Apr 2019 14:55:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=isapego&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;isapego&quot;&gt;isapego&lt;/a&gt;, I&apos;ve checked the patch. Look simple and can be merged.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16821978" author="isapego" created="Fri, 19 Apr 2019 15:02:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=jooger&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;jooger&quot;&gt;jooger&lt;/a&gt; thanks for the review. Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
